<view class="p-root">
  <page-nav title="关于" back="{{true}}"></page-nav>

  <view class="page page--safe">
    <view class="brand">
      <view class="brand__logo"><view class="i i-pill brand__icon"></view></view>
      <text class="brand__name">替你记着吃药</text>
      <text class="brand__ver">v{{version}}</text>
      <text class="brand__desc">只做三件事：按时提醒、记录吃没吃、让家人看见。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="list mt-4">
      <view class="list__row" data-type="privacy" bindtap="goLegal">
        <text class="list__label">隐私政策</text>
        <view class="i i-chevron"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="list__row" data-type="agreement" bindtap="goLegal">
        <text class="list__label">用户协议</text>
        <view class="i i-chevron"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="list__row" data-type="disclaimer" bindtap="goLegal">
        <text class="list__label">免责声明</text>
        <view class="i i-chevron"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="list__row" bindtap="onCopy">
        <text class="list__label">联系客服</text>
        <text class="list__value">support@example.com</text>
        <view class="i i-chevron"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="note">
      本小程序不是医疗器械，不提供诊断、处方或用药建议。药品名称与用药记录属敏感个人信息，仅在你所在家庭组内可见。
    </text>

    <view class="bar"><disclaimer-bar></disclaimer-bar></view>
  </view>
</view>
